      "assertions": [
        "Native and SIP INFO/RFC4733 inputs produce actual signed dtmf.received envelopes for eligible current physical native recipients. Source attribution and source-owner HTTP outcome retain original observed facts.",
        "Fractional/missing-start RTP facts do not synthesize native tones; a fresh representable observation recovers. Fanout keeps same-Participant connections distinct and revocation local.",
        "Independent directional permissions, source custody, original/current audience floors, private/public restoration and retired-call replay exclusion hold through actual IO. Captured outcomes settle after revocation without another write.",
        "Received restart retains attempted output as unknown; owned readers, command queuing, credential refresh and current user step-up preserve source lineage, signal delivery and logical outcomes."
      ]
